>
  <h2>Dedicated Legal Representation in Calvert County, Maryland</h2>
  
  <p>
    Calvert County, a scenic peninsula between the Chesapeake Bay and Patuxent River, is home 
    to a tight-knit community that deserves quality legal representation. From Prince Frederick 
    to Solomons, residents facing personal injury claims or criminal charges can count on 
    Attorney Alex Poberesky for experienced, compassionate advocacy.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Calvert County</h3>
  
  <p>
    Route 2/4 serves as the primary artery through Calvert County, carrying commuters to jobs 
    in Prince George's County and Southern Maryland. This heavily traveled corridor sees frequent 
    accidents, especially during peak commuting hours. We help injury victims throughout Calvert 
    County recover compensation for their injuries and losses.
  </p>
  
  <p>Our Calvert County personal injury practice includes:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Routes 2, 4, and 231</li>
    <li>Truck accidents involving commercial vehicles</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries at local businesses and the Calvert Cliffs Nuclear Power Plant area</li>
    <li>Boating and watercraft accidents on the Chesapeake Bay and Patuxent River</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at CalvertHealth Medical Center and local clinics</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents</li>
    <li>Premises liability claims</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense in Calvert County</h3>
  
  <p>
    If you've been arrested or charged with a crime in Calvert County, time is critical. 
    Whether you're facing DUI charges, drug offenses, assault, or other criminal matters, 
    our experienced defense team will protect your rights from the moment you contact us.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Commitment to Calvert County Clients</h3>
  
  <p>
    Although our office is in Pikesville, we regularly travel to Calvert County to meet with 
    clients and appear in court. We understand that after an injury or arrest, you need an 
    attorney who will give your case the attention it deserves. That's exactly what we provide 
    to every client, regardless of location.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Calvert County Communities</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Calvert County, including Prince Frederick, Solomons, 
    Dunkirk, Chesapeake Beach, North Beach, Lusby, Huntingtown, and St. Leonard. Contact us 
    today for a free consultation about your case.
  </p>
